            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82664,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Veri kümelerini incelerken, bir veri parçasının, örneğin bir anketteki en sık verilen yanıtın, kaç kez bulunduğunu bilmek faydalıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>answers</code> gibi bir listede bir değerin kaç kez göründüğünü saymak için liste adıyla, bir noktayla <code> .</code> ve ardından <code>count()</code> ile başlarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answers.count()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>answers</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>count()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Element to count",
            "id": 82666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>answers</code> listesinde <code>\"yes\"</code> ifadesinin kaç kez göründüğünü saymak için <code>count()</code> fonksiyonunun parantezleri arasına <code>\"yes\"</code> yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(answers.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"75\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"yes\"</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Any type",
            "id": 82667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>count()</code> fonksiyonunu her tür değerle kullanabiliriz; örneğin bir sırada kaç tane <code>True</code> değeri olduğuna bakarak kaç boş koltuk kaldığını kontrol edebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>True</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Reusing",
            "id": 82668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listedeki bir değerin sayısını yeniden kullanmak için bu sayıyı <code>seats_count</code> gibi bir değişkene kaydedebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"seats_count = free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats_count)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>seats_count</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayılacak değeri <code>count()</code> parantezlerine yerleştir. Boolean değerleri sayabilir ve sonucu bir değişkende depolayabilirsin.</p><p><code>free_seats</code> içindeki <code>True</code> girdilerini sayıp sonucu <code>seats_count</code> içinde depola. Böylece kod <code>2</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"seats_count = free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats_count)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>seats_count</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>True</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "At least once",
            "id": 88383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kesin sayıyı bilmek istemiyor, yalnızca <code>\"sugar\"</code> gibi bir öğenin var olup olmadığını öğrenmek istiyorsak <code>in</code> anahtar kelimesini kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>in</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Boolean",
            "id": 88384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"sugar\"</code> gibi bir öğenin <code>\"ingredients\"</code> gibi bir listede olup olmadığını kontrol etmek bize <code>True</code> veya <code>False</code> olmak üzere bir boolean değer verir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"sugar\"</code>, ardından <code>in</code> ve son olarak <code>ingredients</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değer ile liste arasında <code>in</code> kullan. Değer varsa <code>True</code>, yoksa <code>False</code> döndürür.</p><p>İlk kontrolü <code>True</code> yazdıracak şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"sugar\"</code>, ardından <code>in</code> ve son olarak <code>ingredients</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store the boolean",
            "id": 88385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döndürülen boolean değeri <code>has_sugar</code> gibi bir değişkende depolayarak yeniden kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"has_sugar = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(has_sugar)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>has_sugar</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"sugar\"</code> değerinin <code>ingredients</code> listesinde olup olmadığını <code>has_sugar</code> değişkenine kaydet. Böylece kod <code>True</code> yazdırsın.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"has_sugar = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(has_sugar)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>has_sugar</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>\"sugar\"</code>, <code>in</code> ve son olarak <code>ingredients</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
